  rw_cells bsegs m SPA [CB 80 j0'; C8 sh; C8 f1; C8 f2; CB 16 j104; C8 d; C8 w; CB 168 j136; C8 f3] ->
  exists x8 x48 x56 x64 x160 x296,
    rw_cells bsegs m (SPA + 8) [CB 48 x48] /\ rw_cells bsegs m (SPA + 56) [CB 8 x56] /\ rw_cells bsegs m (SPA + 64) [CB 16 x64]
    /\ rw_cells bsegs m (SPA + 104) [CB 16 j104] /\ rw_cells bsegs m (SPA + 120) [C8 d; C8 w]
    /\ rw_cells bsegs m (SPA + 136) [CB 160 x160]
