Theorem huf_rdt_x1_proofA : huf_rdt_stmtA2 AI rng_fs huf_dt_okA AHUF_RDT_X1.
Proof using FFLAG FREL SM0K RSK.
  exact (AF_huf_x1t_bcomp.x1_topB AI fflag rng_fs FFLAG FREL SM0K (AF_huf_x1t_btop.x1_rsB AI fflag rng_fs RSK)).
Qed.
End Asm.
